---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Contact & Book | AOC, Calgary";
const description = "Request a consultation by email and ask about availability with Alex Orlando Counselling in Calgary, Alberta.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="wrap"><section class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Contact / Book · Calgary, Alberta</div><h1>A first conversation.<br>A possible next step.</h1><p class="lead">A chance to ask questions and consider whether AOC is a good fit for what you need.</p></section><div class="content-grid"><section class="contact-panel"><span class="status">Consultation requests by email</span><h2>Request a<br>consultation.</h2><p>I’m currently arranging consultations by email. Select the button below to open a pre-addressed message, then send it to ask about availability.</p><p>Please avoid including detailed personal or clinical information in your first email. Consultation format, fees, and next steps can be discussed in reply.</p><a class="btn" href="mailto:alex@alexorlando.com?subject=Consultation%20Request&amp;body=Hi%20Alex%2C%0A%0AI%27d%20like%20to%20request%20a%20consultation.%20Could%20you%20please%20let%20me%20know%20your%20availability%3F%0A%0AThank%20you.">Book a Consultation <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section><aside class="prose"><h3 style="margin-top:0">Before a consultation</h3><p>You might consider what brought you here, what you hope could change, and any questions about qualifications, approach, or practical arrangements.</p><h3>Need support sooner?</h3><p>This site is not monitored for urgent requests. Explore current <a href="https://www.albertahealthservices.ca/amh/amh.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Alberta support options</a>. In immediate danger or a medical emergency, call <a href="tel:911">911</a>.</p></aside></div></div></main>
</Layout>
